  "caveats": [
    "Inputs are the margin, the clock, possession and the pregame prior only: no fouls, timeouts, bonus or lineups.",
    "The college releases carry no lines: the game page serves home court alone (0.5 at a neutral site), while the booster trains on the weekly as-of ratings prior, so the game page's prior is the weaker of the two served.",
    "Games with no as-of rating (the season's first days, about 10% of games) are not trained on; served, they get the HFA fallback.",
    "Train and holdout seasons are whole seasons: out of sample in time, sharing rules eras.",
    "2024 (the confirmation season) is in no training season, but the pregame constants the rated prior reads were fit on it; its gate is reported, not gated.",
    "The holdout gate is a paired no-regression bar against the fixed booster this refit replaced (the card script's docstring): it is not an absolute calibration bar.",
    "The WBB 2024 release has two wrong horn rows (games 401574803 and 401601119), which the game page settles on their own score: settled Brier 0.0002 on that season."
  ]
